net "LeNet-5"
# MNIST digits, 1×28×28. One block per line: a label, the block, its settings.
1 input
2 conv 6 5x5 pad 2 tanh      # 6 filters, 5×5 kernel, padding 2 keeps 28×28
3 avgpool 2x2                # 28×28 -> 14×14
4 conv 16 5x5 valid tanh     # no padding: 14 -> 10
5 avgpool 2x2                # 10 -> 5
6 flatten                    # 16×5×5 = 400 values
7 dense 120 tanh
8 dense 84 tanh
9 output                     # one score per class (10 for MNIST)
